sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Citizen / Land Officer
  participant UI as Frontend App (React 18)
  participant ValService as Valuation Engine (valuation.ts)
  participant PoAService as PoA Sentinel (poa.ts)
  participant Ledger as Audit Ledger (auditLedger.ts)
  participant Store as Immutable Ledger Store

  Note over User, Store: Phase 1: Land Valuation & Revenue Evasion Detection
  User->>UI: Enter Mouza, Dag 88/88, 5 Katha, Declared ৳6,500,000
  UI->>ValService: calculateLandValuation(mouzaId, area, declaredPrice, frontage)
  ValService->>ValService: Convert 5 Katha to 8.25 Decimals
  ValService->>ValService: Lookup 2026 Gazette Schedule (Uttara Sector 4)
  ValService->>ValService: Compute Official Minimum (8.25 dec * ৳2,600,000 * 1.10 = ৳23,595,000)
  ValService->>ValService: Detect Undervaluation (Declared ৳6.5M < Minimum ৳23.5M)
  ValService->>ValService: Compute Statutory Fees on Taxable Value (Stamp, Reg, Local, AIT)
  ValService-->>UI: Return ValuationResult (isUndervalued: true, fees, difference)
  UI-->>User: Display Revenue Alert & Blocked Stamping Warning

  Note over User, Store: Phase 2: Power of Attorney Pre-Registration Gating
  User->>UI: Submit Deed Execution Request via Attorney (POA-2024-DHK-0914)
  UI->>PoAService: verifyPoaForTransaction(poaId, targetPlotId, targetAction: 'sale')
  PoAService->>PoAService: Check status == 'active' && !deathEventRecorded
  PoAService->>PoAService: Verify targetPlotId in linkedPlotIds
  PoAService->>PoAService: Verify 'sale' in permittedScope
  PoAService-->>UI: Return PoaVerificationResult (isValid: true, messageBn)
  UI-->>User: Display Green Security Verification Badge

  Note over User, Store: Phase 3: Cryptographic Audit Trail Chaining
  UI->>Ledger: recordAuditEvent(eventType: 'VALUATION_SCHEDULE_APPLIED', actorId, payload)
  Ledger->>Store: Fetch previous block's currentHash (H_{n-1})
  Store-->>Ledger: Return H_{n-1}
  Ledger->>Ledger: Serialize event payload canonical JSON (RFC-8785)
  Ledger->>Ledger: Compute SHA-256(canonicalString + H_{n-1})
  Ledger->>Store: Append Block #n with new currentHash (H_n)
  Store-->>Ledger: Confirm Block #n appended
  Ledger-->>UI: Return AuditEvent (id: 'EVT-2026-0043', currentHash: H_n)
  UI-->>User: Display Cryptographic Receipt with Verifiable QR Proof
